          "response": {
            "answer": "[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nFrom: Daniel Whitcombe <d.whitcombe@tasmancoldchain.example>\nTo: Xu Min <xu.min@hewei-catering.example>\nCc: Procurement Team <procurement@hewei-catering.example>; Lu Songping <lu.songping@hewei-catering.example>\nDate: Sat, 04 Jul 2026 19:42:11 +0800\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nSubject: [Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\n\nDear Xu Min,\n\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nFollowing our call this afternoon, I am confirming in writing what happened to\nthe salmon shipment that was scheduled to reach your central kitchen on the\nmorning of 4 July 2026, and what we are doing about it.\n\n1. WHAT HAPPENED\n\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nThe consignment left our Shanghai cold store at 21:10 on 3 July 2026 in truck\nHU-8842. The refrigeration unit on that truck failed in transit during the\nnight. The driver noticed the alarm only at the second rest stop, and by then\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nthe on-board logger had recorded a cargo temperature above 8 degrees Celsius\nfor 6 hours continuously. Our standard for this product is 0 to 4 degrees\nCelsius at all times, so the cold chain was broken well beyond any tolerance\nwe are willing to argue about.\n\n2. WHAT WE DID\n\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nYour receiving team measured the core temperature on arrival and refused the\ndelivery on the spot. That was the correct decision and we fully support it.\nAll 3 pallets were rejected and returned to us; none of the product was\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nre-routed to any other customer. The whole consignment has been destroyed and\nthe destruction certificate is attached to this mail.\n\n3. COMMERCIAL SETTLEMENT\n\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nWe will issue a credit note of CNY 8,600 against your July account. This\ncovers the full value of the rejected consignment. There is nothing for you to\npay and nothing for you to claim separately. The credit note will be raised on\n6 July and should appear on your statement the same week.\n\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\n4. SUPPLY RESUMPTION\n\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nWe cannot cover your salmon requirement from the current stock rotation. The\nnext qualified lot arrives in our cold store on 11 July, and after quality\nrelease we will be able to deliver to you again from 13 July 2026. I know this\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nleaves a gap of about a week in your menu and I am sorry for it. Please treat\n13 July as firm; I will call you myself if anything moves.\n\n5. CORRECTIVE ACTION\n\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nEffective immediately, every truck carrying product to your stores will run two\nindependent temperature loggers instead of one, with the second logger placed\ninside the pallet rather than in the cabin. Readings will be sent to your\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nprocurement mailbox before the truck leaves our yard and again on arrival. The\nfailed unit on HU-8842 has been taken out of service pending overhaul, and we\nhave brought forward the servicing schedule for the rest of the fleet.\n\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\nI am available on my mobile all weekend if you want to go through any of this.\nAgain, my apologies for the disruption to your stores.\n\nBest regards,\n\nDaniel Whitcombe\nKey Account Manager\nTasman Cold Chain Seafood\nMobile: +86 138 5555 0212\nOffice: 021-5555-0201\nd.whitcombe@tasmancoldchain.example\n\n\n[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected\n--\nThis message and any attachments are confidential and intended solely for the\naddressees. If you have received it in error, please notify the sender and\ndelete it from your system.\nKB-042《门店营业时间总表》（2026-01-01 起生效）：S01：门店名称 Super Souper，品类 拉面，商圈 上海·徐汇，标准营业时间 10:30–21:30。\nKB-022《[Tasman Cold Chain Seafood] Salmon delivery of 2026-07-04 - reefer failure, all 3 pallets rejected》（202",
